                "text": "Everyone should be able to access lifesaving medication. With the #InflationReductionAct, we capped insulin costs at $35/month for ppl on Medicare. That means over 3,300 people in NY-16 will save hundreds a year on insulin! We\u2019re going to keep lowering costs for New Yorkers.",
